  "boundary": "Same-cue playback limit (cue numLimits) per logical bundle, ACB and cue. A full cue keeps its newest playbacks: a new start stops the oldest live playback of that cue. 'unspecified' cues carry no cue limit in their ACB and are omitted from limits (skin_delta's TapSE.acb specifies none). Banks without their own sample come from the main sample; the special tap SE skins were read from the official CDN resource version 10.1.0.200, whose TapSE / DirectionalFlickSE cue sheets for skin00-03 and directionalflickskin00 are byte-identical to the main sample's. Cues and bundles not listed have no recovered configuration, except that tapSkinDefault covers any other sound/tapseskin/ bundle. Physical voice pools are not modelled.",
